<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath Bank up 3.2 pct on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Sampath Bank up 3.2 pct on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of blue chip Samapth Bank Ltd rose 3.23 percent or two rupees to 64 on retail buying in early Wednesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is a retail favourite because it is expected to see good growth in 1997. It is also liquid and cheap,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Sampath Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
